OL,3,ASearch for survivors after 16 killed by
OL,4,ARussian double-tap strike on Ukraine
OL,5,Amall
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, local officials said at
OL,8,Fleast two people had been killed by
OL,9,Ffurther Russian strikes early on
OL,10,FSaturday. The defence ministry in
OL,11,FMoscow said it had targeted transport
OL,12,Finfrastructure and warehouses.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
